cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the OhdsiAtlasClient clients in research, please cite this repository."
title: "OhdsiAtlasClient clients: Python and R clients for OHDSI ATLAS 3.0"
abstract: >-
  Modern, aligned Python and R clients for the OHDSI ATLAS 3.0 and WebAPI 3.0
  REST API, with URL discovery, personal API-key authentication, cohort
  definition set bundles, concept-set tooling, and complete endpoint coverage.
